<!-- T7.3: Fechtkarte's own redraw of the compass-wheel diagram on Rostock MS Var.82, folio 2v
     (see docs/DESIGN_CHOICES.md and docs/ASSET_PROVENANCE.md) — a centre point, eight rays to
     two concentric rings, the direct historical ancestor of Direction/Radius/Slot. An original
     redraw of the same geometric structure, not a trace of the scan's own linework, in the
     app's own ink-on-paper palette (CardPalette.INK/PAPER) so it reads as one visual family with
     every rendered MeyerSquareCard rather than as a foreign inserted image. -->
